[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17284.15, "timestamp": "04:48:04", "text": "是的，主要就是这样。哦，是的，大部分情况下是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17289.03, "timestamp": "04:48:09", "text": "就像这样。我的天哪。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17292.07, "timestamp": "04:48:12", "text": "呃，为了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17295.35, "timestamp": "04:48:15", "text": "呃，这种情况很少见。这种情况很少见。哦，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17298.708, "timestamp": "04:48:18", "text": "突然意识到这种情况很少见。哦，他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17301.91, "timestamp": "04:48:21", "text": "就用了这个。我妈妈和哦一起去了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17303.99, "timestamp": "04:48:23", "text": "等等，等等，等等。我觉得我可以做到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17311.19, "timestamp": "04:48:31", "text": "呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17314.628, "timestamp": "04:48:34", "text": "是的，更像是这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17317.51, "timestamp": "04:48:37", "text": "或者别的什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17325.83, "timestamp": "04:48:45", "text": "是的，它有点像这颗钻石。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17328.788, "timestamp": "04:48:48", "text": "牌面上它叫什么？黑桃。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17331.43, "timestamp": "04:48:51", "text": "不知道。是钻石，对吧？是的，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17334.55, "timestamp": "04:48:54", "text": "像钻石一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17339.03, "timestamp": "04:48:59", "text": "我突然意识到它就像一颗钻石。"}]